	(text "Revision X    Date 2026-11-27    Doc No RR-EL-TEST\n\nSynthetic generator/router scale test - not a product.\n\nLayers: 6    Thickness: 1.60 mm\nRails: +3V3, +5V, GND\nNet class HC: track 1.50 mm, clearance 0.30 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [VBAT, VBAT_F, VBAT_S]\nNet class MID: track 0.80 mm, clearance 0.25 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [+12V, VLED]\nNet class PWR: track 0.40 mm, clearance 0.20 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [+5V, +3V3, GND]\n\nThis schematic is generated from board.py by tools/eda (rrkicad).\nAll nets are connected by name (global labels / power symbols); there are no drawn wires between symbols."
